=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} - (H-6) to begin the quest and to receive the {@k}{k:Sack of victuals}.
* Head to the Benedikt Watchtower in {z:North Gustaberg (S)} at (E-11) and speak to {n:Roderich}.
** Use the {p:Campaign Arbiters} to reach this tower quickly, then go east, as it is nearby.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)}.
* Travel to {z:Xarcabard (S)} for a cutscene and your {@k}{k:Commander's endorsement}.
* Examine the {p:Forbidding Portal} at the North West Corner of (I-7) for a cutscene. Examine it again to enter the battlefield.
** Trusts may be used in this fight.
** Any job with item level 119 equipment should have no trouble clearing the fight.
** When entering, you will fight one humanoid who uses all sword weapon skills, frequently double attacks, and uses {p:Mighty Strikes} at 50%.
** Your opponent will randomly select a player and that player will lose all enmity.
** Magic spells (especially nukes and enhancing magic) seem to gain disproportionate enmity in this battle.
** At approximately 50% your opponent will do a monster two-hour animation and gain access to a new AoE weapon skill named **Temblor Blade** with the additional effect of petrify.
** Should you lose this battle, speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} for another {@k}{k:Commander's endorsement}.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} for a cutscene and your reward.

If you are working on missions then return to {M:Fate in Haze|Fate in Haze|Fate in Haze}.
